                <p class="c1"><span class="c19 c5 c3">1. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; DESCRIPTION OF RATING, TENURE OF THE SOW, REVALIDATION, UNDERTAKINGS AND WARRANTIES</span></p>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3">1.1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">Credit Rating</span>&rdquo; or &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">Rating</span>&rdquo; refers to evaluating the capabilities of a company to timely meets its debt obligations expressed in the form of standard symbols or in any other standardized manner, assigned by ICRA and used by your Company to comply with a requirement specified by the Regulations. A Credit Rating does not address any other risk, including liquidity risk, market value risk, or price volatility. Any Rating must be construed solely as a statement of opinion and not a statement of fact. A Credit Rating is not an offer, invitation, inducement, or recommendation to purchase, sell or hold any securities or otherwise deal or act in relation to any issue or Scheme(ies) to which this Agreement relates or otherwise in connection with any associated transaction, entity, or matter. References in this Agreement (inclusive of this SOW) to &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">rating</span>&rdquo; or &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">credit rating</span>&rdquo; also encompass any revalidation of Rating and the terms of this Agreement (inclusive of this SOW) will apply to any revalidation Rating.</span></p>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 100px; padding-left:4px;">1.2 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Description of Services; Rating for <span class="c5">{!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.VoD_in_crore__c}" /> </apex:outputText> {!Opportunity.Crore_or_Million__c}</span> <!--crore(s)-->  (hereinafter referred to as the &ldquo;Scheme&rdquo;) of <strong>{!Opportunity.Account.Name}</strong> (hereinafter referred to as &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">your Company</span>&rdquo; or &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">you</span>&rdquo; or &ldquo;<span class="c5 c3">your</span>&rdquo;) is an investment manager to the Scheme.  Upon acceptance or use of the Rating by your Company in the manner set out in clause D (I) of the Agreement, and subject to the terms and conditions of the Agreement (inclusive of this SOW), ICRA will keep the Rating under surveillance during the lifetime of the Scheme that is such time that any amount is outstanding against it, or the sanction remains valid, whichever is earlier</span></p>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3">1.3 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tenure of the SOW. This SOW shall remain valid till the time the Rating assigned is withdrawn in accordance with the Regulations and ICRA policy on withdrawal of credit ratings framed thereunder which is available at www.icra.in or the date that there are no longer any obligations outstanding under the Scheme. Subject to applicable law, Parties may terminate this SOW only after withdrawal of the Rating assigned under this SOW.</span></p>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c3">1.4 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Sanctions Warranty.  You warrant that your Company is not subject to individual or country sanctions imposed by the United Nations, United States, European Union, or United Kingdom (&rdquo;Sanctions&rdquo;) by virtue of (i) being on a published sanctions list or (ii) located in a sanctioned country (any person or entity described in (i) or (ii) being a &ldquo;Sanctions Target&rdquo;), or (iii) owned (50% or more) or controlled by one or more Sanctions Target(s).  You further warrant that your Company is not subject to any other economic or financial sanctions which prohibit the provision by ICRA of the services under this Agreement.  Further, to the best of your informed knowledge no portfolio company of the Company is subject to Sanctions. You agree to notify ICRA forthwith if any of these warranties cease to be accurate, and that if ICRA determines it is prohibited by any applicable law or regulation from providing any of the services hereunder it may terminate such services to the extent permitted under all applicable laws.</span></p>
