                <span class="c5 c3">2. &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; FEES AND INVOICE ADDRESS.</span>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 100px; text-align:left">2.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Initial Rating Fee payable by your Company to ICRA is {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.IRF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/- exclusive of applicable taxes.</span></p>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 100px;">2.2 &nbsp;&nbsp; The Annual Surveillance Fee for monitoring of the assigned Ratings under this SOW will be {!Opportunity.CurrencyIsoCode}&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.ASF_Final_Amount__c}" /> </apex:outputText>/-, exclusive of applicable taxes and shall be payable each year on the anniversary of the initial rating assignment. Payment of Annual Surveillance fee shall be due on receipt of the invoice and is not contingent upon the timing of performance of surveillance by ICRA. The said Annual Surveillance Fee shall be annually increased by&nbsp;
                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c != 'Other' }">
                        {! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c}
                    </apex:outputPanel>
                    <apex:outputPanel rendered="{! Opportunity.Surveillance_Fee_Revision_Maximum_new__c == 'Other' }">
                        <apex:outputText value="{0,number,###0.00}">
                        <apex:param value="{! Opportunity.Other__c }"/>
                    </apex:outputText>%
                    </apex:outputPanel> of the last paid Annual Surveillance Fee from each subsequent billing anniversary. Notwithstanding anything contained herein, ICRA shall charge a minimum Annual Surveillance Fee as per the fee structure available on its website i.e. www.icra.in which may be amended by ICRA from time to time irrespective of the value of outstanding debt.</span></p>

                <p class="c1 c4"><span class="c0 c73 c42"></span></p>
                <p class="c1 c15 c24"><span class="c2">2.3 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; It is hereby clarified that notwithstanding your non-acceptance of the Rating or failure to notify ICRA of your acceptance/non-acceptance of the Rating, any use of the Rating by your Company, in any manner whatsoever, shall constitute acceptance of such Rating and your Company shall be obligate your Company to pay the Annual Surveillance Fee after ICRA becomes aware of the use of the Rating. Initial Rating Fee/Annual Surveillance Fee shall be paid by your Company within&nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Payment_Terms__c}" /> </apex:outputText> days from the date of invoice, by way of cheque or demand draft (DD) or transfer through electronic medium in favour of &ldquo;ICRA Limited&rdquo;. ICRA reserves the right to recover interest on any delayed payment, at the rate of &nbsp;<apex:outputText value="{0,number,#,##0.00}"> <apex:param value="{!Opportunity.Delayed_Payment_Interest_Rate__c}" /> </apex:outputText> % p.a. on the amount due.  All Fees as mentioned herein shall not be refundable under any circumstances.</span></p>


